{"output":"I’ll inspect project authorization, list caching, and the existing tests, then patch the isolation bugs and run verification.\n\nProject detail reads lack a membership check, and updates reuse that unchecked path. List cache keys omit the organization, while updates invalidate no lists. I’ll add ownership authorization and an unambiguous organization cache prefix, keeping the existing authorization check before cache access.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations and preserves every pagination/sorting variant. Updates invalidate only the owning organization’s lists; authorization still runs before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests without changing existing tests or installing dependencies.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0, no blockers.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations and preserves every pagination/sorting variant. Updates invalidate only the owning organization’s lists; authorization still runs before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests without changing existing tests or installing dependencies.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0, no blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":7,"tool_calls":[{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; cat package.json; cat src/{app.ts,types.ts} src/auth/*.ts src/cache/*.ts src/routes/{projects,organizations}.ts src/services/*.ts src/db/*.ts src/http/list-options.ts tests/projects.test.ts README.md","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/1-1-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":195,"stdout_bytes":13224,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-r